OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire falls silent to mark
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across Yorkshire have come
OL,7,Ftogether to mark Remembrance Sunday and
OL,8,Fhonour the lives of those killed in
OL,9,Fservice.
OL,11,FFamilies, military personnel, veterans
OL,12,Fand local groups held services to
OL,13,Fobserve the national two-minute
OL,14,Fsilence, and lay wreaths at war
OL,15,Fmemorials around the region.
OL,17,FIn Leeds, hundreds of people watched as
OL,18,Fa parade of ex-servicemen and women and
OL,19,Fserving military personnel marched
OL,20,Fthrough the city to Millennium Square.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
