OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire falls silent to mark
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those taking part was 91-year-old
OL,7,FKenneth Naylor, from Leeds, who spoke
OL,8,Fof his "honour" at being one of the
OL,9,Fflag-bearers at the event.
